        "slc_560c23b285b8ed866d51782f60cdbe0a865105112589df123b7bd264b5445386"
      ],
      "text": "Herm is described as a model-agnostic, general-purpose AI agent built for safe, flexible execution, natively supporting multiple isolation methods including containers, in-process Unix-like sandboxes, and host sandboxes such as sandbox_exec on macOS or bubblewrap on Linux."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_a75511beb25b34f32b212d997afee17d4c6dc290d70d1abe5580445c5012d57e",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "tools-permissions",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "4bcb16ba05da6bdfc9b963c8c1fa14a51e743819",
          "git_sha": "b47664528c65909747fb171c4814c620308e69bf",
          "line_end": 9,
          "line_start": 9,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "aduermael/herm",
          "url": "https://github.com/aduermael/herm/blob/4bcb16ba05da6bdfc9b963c8c1fa14a51e743819/README.md#L9-L9"
        },
        {
          "commit": "4bcb16ba05da6bdfc9b963c8c1fa14a51e743819",
          "git_sha": "b47664528c65909747fb171c4814c620308e69bf",
          "line_end": 17,
          "line_start": 17,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "aduermael/herm",
          "url": "https://github.com/aduermael/herm/blob/4bcb16ba05da6bdfc9b963c8c1fa14a51e743819/README.md#L17-L17"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_bb234f3ee00e7a835dafe177fd24b4d43b4adbf1ae4da00d043746c293a5464d",
        "slc_ce5b98b7ded5cb350765bb6551dbbac665473f4c57e56880f9e30ff9bf2740ca"
      ],
      "text": "By default the CLI runs the agent inside Docker containers that can only access files from the current working directory, with no permission prompts."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_22e53c0df0dbc699689299f26bb9bfa8ee848755b0fbb7f7092597f9a362ffb7",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "4bcb16ba05da6bdfc9b963c8c1fa14a51e743819",
          "git_sha": "b47664528c65909747fb171c4814c620308e69bf",
          "line_end": 21,
          "line_start": 21,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "aduermael/herm",
          "url": "https://github.com/aduermael/herm/blob/4bcb16ba05da6bdfc9b963c8c1fa14a51e743819/README.md#L21-L21"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_21e1da80c2c3732f182dd54b76b7daf22a163691d36db4582dfddee4dcb67ca1"
      ],
      "text": "Herm extends container environments by writing Dockerfiles dynamically, with environments scoped per project (the current working directory)."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_46f2b966e1746f8d27133217200ad2398e2a57f4088e6650b3caf89747da31fc",
