        "slc_7182f4844b8495df5b93947f6efc656b118c7e358629d4913823c8f7139c4fe2"
      ],
      "text": "Documented CLI flags include --version, --debug, --prompt for headless mode, --cpsl to run with a CPSL local sandbox library, and --naked to run without Docker or CPSL."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_f9b26289654df7b531464da0042f0bdc5515e4be9583255bc60dea59a9746a5f",
