        "slc_e2745557b07f5f5ef69b690cc106dc06cc20004c57607732263190c7d53fb54a"
      ],
      "text": "The CLI is a terminal TUI with an event loop selecting on stdin, agent events, and async results; agent events include Thinking, ToolCall, Approval, and Done, and sub-agent events continue to be drained after the main agent stops."
    },
